        "collapsible_text_RqT9H9": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "30-Day Lowest Price Guarantee",
            "content": "<p>Order now to skip shipping delay.We guarantee prices for orders placed between 4th, NOV and 4th, DEC; If you find a lower price(from our official website) within 30 days of your purchase; we'll issue a refund to your original payment for the price difference.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_rNPFRe": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "60-Day Price Guarantee",
            "content": "<p>If the price of your purchase changes <strong>within 60 days</strong> of your order, resulting in you paying more or missing out on a gift, please contact us. We will <strong>refund the price difference</strong> or send the complimentary gift.</p><p>*Only <strong>for orders starting after 1st, Nov, 2025</strong><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_AaPGYX": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Main Specs & Dimensions",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>500LBS</strong> Weight Capacity</li><li>Running Area Size：<strong>20×55</strong> in</li><li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/SR2cuPUdZ2c\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://youtu.be/SR2cuPUdZ2c\">0-15% Auto Incline, 15 Levels</a></li><li>Good For <strong>Tall People</strong></li><li>Speed of 1.0-10.0mph(Adjustable)</li><li>Net Weight：54.28 Kg/119.68Lbs. If you can lift 33 LBS(15Kg) moving the treadmill will be a breeze.</li><li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/B4NkI76A-0o\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://youtu.be/B4NkI76A-0o\">Comes 95% Pre-assembled</a></li><li>With <strong>Foldable</strong> Desktop</li><li><strong>Free App</strong> Subscription</li><li>Heart Rate Monitor</li><li><strong>12</strong> Preset Programs</li><li><strong>3-Year</strong> Warranty</li><li>AI Voice Control | Console Control | 3D VR</li><li>Built-in Bluetooth Music Player</li><li>Product Folded Size: 63 x 27.6 x 8.26 in</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_EPcURV": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "🎁 Order Early for a Stress-Free Holiday (Christmas Tips)",
            "content": "<p>Buying early means your gift won’t arrive late — and even if the recipient prefers something else, you’ll still have time to switch to a perfect Plan B.<br/>Ordering now also helps you avoid holiday shipping delays and ensures your treadmill arrives well before Christmas.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_AjtHi9": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why It called TM029 Pro?",
            "content": "<p>The TM029 PRO is the upgraded version of the TM029. By upgrading the incline motor, this model is now able to support automatic incline, offering up to a 15% incline with 15 adjustable levels. This enhancement adds an extra 3% incline compared to the previous model, delivering a more versatile and challenging workout experience.</p><p>Meanwhile, we also improved the console buttons based on previous TM029's user feedback. The 2026 upgraded TM029 added quick speed (3 / 6 / 9 mph) / incline(3% / 7% / 9%) adjustment buttons, allowing easier and more convenient access. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_TCr478": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the Difference between TM029 & TM024?",
            "content": "<p>The TM029 pro features a 55-inch running belt, <strong>10 inches longer</strong> than the TM024. It also offers a<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Fzz6WkTisk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Fzz6WkTisk\"><strong>15% auto incline</strong></a>, compared to the TM024’s 5% manual incline, making adjustments easier and workouts more intense. With <strong>higher-quality materials</strong>, the TM029 has a more premium look and feel. The TM029 also <strong>offers a higher weight capacity of 500 Lbs</strong> while the TM024 is 450 Lbs and a <strong>more powerful motor</strong> of <strong>4.5HP</strong> while the TM024 is 4HP.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_etCW8W": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "30-Day Risk-Free Return & 3-Year Warranty Support",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>30-Day Return Window</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Enjoy a simple & <strong>hassle-free return</strong> process — WELLFIT will offer custmers a pre-paid return label when<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>applicable</strong></a>. Customers don't need to pay for the return shipping.</p><p>How the <strong>3-Year Warranty</strong> Works:</p><ul><li><strong>a)Part Replacement: </strong>Send us a video of the issue, and we'll ship the required parts along with step-by-step video instructions. </li><li><strong>b)Local Repair: </strong>If a local technician is more convenient, you may have the repair done locally with WELLFIT approval. Just send us a video of the issue before repair and a copy of the receipt after-we'll reimburse the cost.</li><li><strong>c)Free Replacement:</strong> If the product cannot be repaired during the warranty period, you will get a free replacement.</li><li><strong>d)Full or Partial Refund: </strong>If repair or replacement isn't feasible or preferred, we may offer a refund based on the product's condition and the issue's severity.</li><li><strong>e)Professional Support:</strong> We provide professional support with a dedicated technical team for online technical assistance.</li></ul><p><strong>*Note:</strong> WELLFIT will evaluate the actual situation and offer our customers best solution.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_LUfTwb": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tax-Free, No Extra Tax Added At Checkout",
            "content": "<p>Purchase directly from the WELLFIT treadmill official website and enjoy <strong>tax-free</strong> benefits, as WELLFIT will cover the sales tax. Consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax.</strong>  Compared with buying on other platforms, saving you more.Our official website also honors <strong>3-year </strong>free warranty, while other platform only offer 1-year limited warranty. Strong warranty protection for peace of mind</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
