            "media_position": "start",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "15% Auto Incline Adjustable For Different Workout Intensity",
            "content": "<p>Effortlessly customize your workout intensity with the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Fzz6WkTisk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Fzz6WkTisk\">15% auto incline feature</a>. Whether you're looking to challenge yourself with uphill climbs or keep it light with a steady walk, the adjustable incline lets you tailor your routine to meet your fitness goals, all at the touch of a button.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
