    "accordion_content_k7PhRH": {
      "type": "accordion-content",
      "blocks": {
        "item_n6ddLw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I am 5.5 feet 420 lbs, is this treadmill suitable for me?",
            "content": "<p>The TM029 treadmill is designed for individuals up to 6 feet in height and has a maximum weight capacity of 500lbs, making it ideal for tall people.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_xByMc4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can it be used on carpet/wood/tile?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it can be used on carpet/wood/tile. <a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/?reel-id=246243&l-view=default_view\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/?reel-id=246243&l-view=default_view\"><strong>Watch Video</strong></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_HWLHba": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it require assembly?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, but it comes with 95% assembled, just unfold and secure frame with tools provided. 2-Step installation, super easy! </p><p>Assemble Video: <br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/B4NkI76A-0o\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://youtu.be/B4NkI76A-0o\">https://youtu.be/B4NkI76A-0o</a></p><p>*Note: The folding mechanism requires to unscrew the screws on the arm joint to fold</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_w8de94": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it have smart features?",
            "content": "<p>All of our treadmills can connect to the <strong>WELLFIT App (free to use)</strong>, where you can track your workout data, set training plans, and even control the treadmill directly from your phone — including <strong>voice control</strong>.</p><p>You can also enjoy <strong>first-person scenic running</strong> through the app for a more immersive workout experience.</p><p>In addition, the treadmill syncs with <strong>Apple Health </strong>and supports <strong>Kinomap</strong> and <strong>Zwift</strong> for interactive training. It is also compatible with <strong>FitShow</strong>, <strong>WHOOP</strong>, and other apps that support the <strong>FTMS</strong> (Fitness Machine Service) protocol, ensuring broader connectivity with your favorite fitness platforms.<br/><br/>For safety, it includes a <strong>safety key</strong> — when detached, the machine stops immediately to prevent injury. The overall performance is also designed to run <strong>quietly</strong>, making it suitable for home use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kNPnQx": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need a subscription to use the treadmill? Are the subscription and app free?",
            "content": "<p>You can use the treadmill without connecting to an app. Our treadmill has physical buttons on the console or handle, so you can control it via console or remote. Meanwhile, the app is lifetime free to use, no fees at all. The app is to create a mount of scenarios and sports plan. Enter the WELLFIT app workout page before you can record the data. The subscription is just for us to send workout tips and monthly deals. No charges at all.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_xyVnaT": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it come with a remote control?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it comes with a Bluetooth-connected remote. With the smart feature, you can also control the device using the App.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_cWmTQh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it have any incline level? Automatic or Manual?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it has <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Fzz6WkTisk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Fzz6WkTisk\">auto 15% incline.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3969iU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it easy for storage?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it's easy to store, you can unscrew the screws and fold it to store when you are not in use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_KRhKWr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to activate the mute mode?",
            "content": "<p>Press the \"+\" button constantly until the display shows \"off\". </p>"
          }
        },
        "item_TCzE4d": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "How quiet is it?",
            "content": "<p>Less than 40dB when working, just like whispering, super quiet. Don't have to worry about a loud motor in the background of your meetings or when your roomie demands peace and quiet.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_txXMxz": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When my order ship and by which carrier",
            "content": "<p>Your order will be delivered to your provided address within 1-5 working days. We use major shipping carriers such as FedEx Ground, UPS, and DHL for our deliveries.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_dqUcmL": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the speed range?",
            "content": "<p>It has as speed range of 1.0-10.0mph.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_ewbC7y": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to use the treadmill bluetooth speaker?",
            "content": "<p>Turn on the treadmill and wait for standby mode. Press and hold the “−” button for 3 seconds until you hear a beep. Search and connect:<br/><strong>WELLFIT TM Audio (for speaker)</strong><br/><strong>WELLFIT TM Linker (for app)</strong><br/>“Connected” will appear once pairing is successful.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_gnUmWG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does the order need to pay for shipping & Tax?",
            "content": "<p>All orders are free shipping and tax-free</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_HbHK9W": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do your items have a product warranty?",
            "content": "<p>We offer a 3-year free warranty; For details, please check the warranty policy page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_icLkgK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship to Puerto Rico or outside the United States?",
            "content": "<p>No, we only ship within the contiguous US 48 states, excluding Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico....and also excluding any PO BOXES (sorry, but we can't ship our items to any PO BOX, period).</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pAGjUA": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "My item arrived but damaged! what do l do?",
            "content": "<p>First, take a deep breath. It is difficult for major shipping companies to deliver heavy packages across the United States flawlessly every time. We recommend opening the box and looking inside. The items are packaged fairly well on the inside, so just because the outside box is stained doesn't mean the contents are dirty as well.<br/><br/>If you do encounter problems, please contact us immediately. Don't start disassembling the item just yet and put the item back in the box. Please contact us first to see if there is an easier solution. We have many replacement parts and knowledgeable staff on hand to help with any situation. You can contact us: service@uswellfit.com</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_eJ7AUR": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I find the user manual for the product?",
            "content": "<p>The paper instruction manual is attached to the product packaging box, you can also contact our service support to get the PDF/word manual.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Q9NdJG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What safety features does it have?",
            "content": "<p>We have safety lock on the treadmill,When the user falls, the clip detaches from the key, causing the belt to stop automatically.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_jGpDry": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I contact you if my questions are not listed here?",
            "content": "<p>You can contact us by livechat, email to <a href=\"mailto:service@wellfittreadmill.com\" title=\"mailto:service@wellfittreadmill.com\">service@wellfittreadmill.com</a> or make a phone call to +1 (281) 777-8190</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Uw3n8P": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Am I able to replace my remote for my walking pad?",
            "content": "<p>For sure, we can send a replacement remote control to you if yours broke. Or you can directly buy from us.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
